<BaseLayout
  title="About ThaiKeto — Your Thai Keto Cooking Guide"
  description="ThaiKeto helps you combine the bold flavors of Thai cuisine with the ketogenic diet. Recipes, guides, and product recommendations."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-display font-semibold text-primary mb-8">About ThaiKeto</h1>

    <div class="prose-thai">
      <p class="text-lg text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        ThaiKeto was born from a simple observation: Thai cuisine is one of the most flavorful food traditions in the world, and it's surprisingly compatible with the ketogenic diet — if you know how to adapt it.
      </p>

      <h2>Our Mission</h2>
      <p>
        We help keto dieters enjoy authentic Thai flavors without the carbs. From creamy coconut curries to tangy tom yum soups, Thai food is naturally rich in healthy fats and aromatic herbs — the perfect foundation for keto cooking.
      </p>

      <h2>What We Cover</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Thai Keto Recipes:</strong> Step-by-step recipes for keto-friendly versions of classic Thai dishes — curries, soups, stir-fries, and salads.</li>
        <li><strong>Ingredient Guides:</strong> Deep dives into Thai ingredients — which are keto-friendly, which to avoid, and where to find substitutes.</li>
        <li><strong>Meal Plans:</strong> Complete weekly meal plans built around Thai keto recipes, with macros calculated.</li>
        <li><strong>Product Roundups:</strong> Honest reviews of keto-friendly Thai cooking products — coconut aminos, curry pastes, konjac noodles, and more.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Our Approach</h2>
      <p>
        Every recipe on ThaiKeto is tested for both authenticity and keto compliance. We don't just swap rice for cauliflower and call it a day — we research traditional Thai cooking methods, understand the role of each ingredient, and find the best low-carb alternatives that preserve the dish's soul.
      </p>

      <h2>Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
      <p>
        ThaiKeto participates in the Amazon Associates program. When you purchase products through our links, we may earn a small commission at no extra cost to you. This helps us continue creating free content. We only recommend products we genuinely believe in.
      </p>
    </div>
